  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Electrification Program for rural and marginal urban areas of Ecuador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Electrificacin Rural y Urbano-Marginal del Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Proyecto es aumentar y mejorar el acceso de la poblacin rural y Urbano-Marginal (UM) a la energa elctrica. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) incrementar la capacidad institucional del Gobierno de la Repblica del Ecuador (GdE) para la formulacin, ejecucin, monitoreo y evaluacin de proyectos de Electrificacin Rural (ER) y UM; y (ii) financiar un programa eficiente de inversiones en proyectos de ER y UM en apoyo al Fondo de Electrificacin Rural y Urbano-Marginal (FERUM).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programs general objective is to increase and improve access by the rural and marginal urban population to electric energy. Its specific objectives are to: (i) increase the institutional capacity of the Government of Ecuador to formulate, execute, monitor, and evaluate rural and marginal urban electrification projects; and (ii) finance an efficient program for investment in rural and marginal urban electrification projects in support of the Fund for Rural and Marginal Urban Electrification (FERUM).</narrative>
  </description>
